                                       Backlog
A Backlog is a prioritized list of work items that an Agile Team may work on in the future.

Why do we need a Backlog?
- To maintain all pending work in one place.
- To prioritize work based on business requirements.
- To help teams decide what to work on next.
- To plan upcoming iterations.
- To avoid losing track of new requirements.


