                                       Kanban in Adobe Workfront
Kanban is an Agile method used to visualize work and manage its flow continuously using a board.
Unlike Scrum, Kanban does not require fixed-length iterations.

For this we need to select the kanban methodology 

. Why do we need Kanban?
- To visualize all ongoing work.
- To identify pending work.
- To manage continuous incoming requests.
- To identify bottlenecks.
- To avoid taking on too much work simultaneously.


